 "learning_approach": "<ol> <li>Introduction to data (attributes, relationships, behaviours)</li> <li>Visual representations of data, information and knowledge</li> <li>Visual querying, interaction and exploration</li> <li>Textual data visualization</li> <li>Zoomable interfaces, &ldquo;Focus+Context&rdquo; navigation</li> <li>Hypermedia (web) visualisation</li> <li>High-dimensional visualization</li> <li>Introduction of visual data analytics</li> <li>Behavior-driven data visualization</li> <li>Evaluation, visualisation and interaction</li> </ol>",
