 "description": "<p>This subject focuses on the vital technologies of data visualisation and visual interaction that underpin visual analytics and decision-making. You&#39;ll engage with recent data visualisation literature and practice using advanced software. The subject outlines the visual data analytics process and methodology, including the critical role of human interaction with interactive visual interfaces. Upon completion, you&#39;ll be adept at designing and evaluating sophisticated visualisation interfaces, positioning you for roles as a data visualisation designer and visual data analyst.</p>",
