 "teaching_strategies": "<p>This subject is comprised of an introductory lecture (week 1) and workshops (weeks 2 to 12). Each week of workshops is self-paced through the learning management system. You are expected to complete a range of different learning activities throughout the week. Activities provide opportunities to learn, apply and discuss the knowledge gained in a practical manner. Feedback is provided from both peers and teaching staff throughout the activities. You are encouraged to actively provide feedback and interact with staff and students. The workshops will allow you to interact with staff and students, ask questions and receive clarification and feedback.</p>",
